{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1401882-how-worth-1e-corerulebook-only-for-reading","id":1401882,"title":"How worth 1e Corerulebook only for reading","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-09T03:02:28-07:00","id":1401882,"title":"How worth 1e Corerulebook only for reading","content":"To explain it more, in german the only CofD books that are available for WtF are the Corerules and Predators. Now I want to ask here, how much worth would it be, to buy those limited books only for reading about the world because I got a little curious how forsaken would differ from apocalypse?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":26160,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","user":"Koronus","date":". 04-26-2024, 01:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T08:12:34-07:00","id":1402069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Koronus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1401882-how-worth-1e-corerulebook-only-for-reading#post1401882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To explain it more, in german the only CofD books that are available are VtR Corerules, Coteries, Lancae Sanctum, Antagonists and WtF Corerules. Now I want to ask here, how much worth would it be, to by the corerulebook of the first edition only for reading about the world because I got a little curious how forsaken would differ from apocalypse?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My humble point:<br /> <br /> Keep always in mind that Forsaken is not Apocalypse 2.0 or ''another version'' of Apocalypse.<br /> Forsaken is a game. Apocalypse is another game.<br /> Despite this, I would strongly recommend to read every Forsaken book you can find, even 1st edition, because every book of forsaken is pure gold. Also, 2nd edition doesn't mean that now the whole 1st ed collection is worthless or without any importance.<br /> My favorites from first edition are: Core book, Lore of The Forsaken, The Pure, The Rage, Blood of the Wolf.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":3773,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","user":"Helur","date":". 07-10-2020, 11:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T08:34:35-07:00","id":1402074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"